-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 8.9.1998 (הסתדרות המורים): the wage agreement for
-- 1.10.97–31.12.98 between the State, the local authorities and the three
-- large cities, and הסתדרות המורים בישראל — the twin of the agreement the
-- same employers signed the same day with ארגון המורים העל-יסודיים
-- (l4/agreements/oz-latmura/1998-09-08_oz-latmura_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul.l4,
-- imported). Whom it covers and its period (§§2–3); the reward for escorting
-- trips and out-of-school activity in activity units of 0.7% of the monthly
-- combined salary, by the hour an activity ends (§4), within 1.2% (§5); the
-- management, education and profession allowances raised (§§6–8) within
-- 1.9% (§9); provident-fund contributions on the components that are not
-- pensionable, within 0.8% (§10, carried out by the agreement of 17.12.98);
-- the reward and incentive for required teachers of §9 of the agreement of
-- 19.9.94 kept (§11); the general provisions and the joint committee
-- (§§12–13); and, as annex א', §2 of the parity committee's decision of
-- 25.11.86.
--
-- WHERE THE WORDS ARE THE OZ AGREEMENT'S, THE RULE IS IMPORTED, NOT COPIED:
-- §§2–4, 6–10, 12–13 and annex א' print the same rules (the differences are
-- spelling, the parties' names and a comma), so each is the Oz module's rule
-- under this agreement's name, and the table of §4.ד, as this agreement
-- prints it, is held to the Oz agreement's row by row. WHERE THEY DIFFER IT
-- IS ENCODED HERE: the cost of §§4 and 10 comes from §14 of the agreement
-- with הסתדרות המורים of 19.9.94, not from §5 of the Oz agreement of 31.8.94
-- (§§5, 10.4–10.5), and §11 keeps §9 of that agreement — the reward and
-- incentive for required teachers ("תגמול ותמרוץ עובדי הוראה נדרשים") — not
-- the Oz agreement's §21 personal contracts, and says nothing of a quota.
-- The agreement of 19.9.94 is held by the corpus and not yet encoded. §4(י)
-- settles the claims of §30 of the agreement of 11.5.93
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/1993-05-11_histadrut-hamorim_wage-agreement-1993.l4),
-- which this file imports.
--
-- The base agreement of 25.12.2008, §40 (base-agreement-40), and the
-- reform founding agreement of 10.9.2007, §30, pay its reward for hours
-- beyond the reform's work hours; the completion agreement of 29.2.2012,
-- §29, puts a table of its own in place of §4.ד for teachers under the
-- reform, and the wage agreement of 19.10.2022, §13, its unit's base from
-- 1.9.2023 — each imports this file. It speaks to no pay item of
-- l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is in no root.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `1998-09-08_oz-latmura_out-of-school-activity_livui-tiyulim-gmul`
IMPORT `1993-05-11_histadrut-hamorim_wage-agreement-1993`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — תגמול בגין ליווי טיולים ופעילות חוץ בית ספרית עם תלמידים (8.9.1998, הסתדרות המורים)`

DECLARE `1998 Histadrut agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `decide the further localities for the reward of required teachers`
    `raise a claim on contributions under §14 of 19.9.94`
    `negotiate further on pay and terms in the 1998 Histadrut agreement's period`
    `strike or lock out over a matter the 1998 Histadrut agreement settled`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp (15.3.1999, no. 7065/98); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 A handwritten number; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The Hebrew date of signing; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The State, its representatives' names left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities, its representative's name left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The three large cities, their representative's name left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "All together and each apart"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 "Side A"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The union and its secretary-general; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 "Side B"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: the parties negotiated the teachers' pay and terms.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: they set the understandings down in a collective agreement.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶5: the day of signing, the Oz agreement's own.
@ref akn:preamble/p5
`the 1998 Histadrut agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 8 9 1998

#ASSERT `the 1998 Histadrut agreement was signed on` EQUALS `the 1998 Oz agreement was signed on`

§§ `1–3 מבוא, תחולה ותוקף`

-- akn:art_1 The heading of §1.
-- akn:art_2 The heading of §2.
-- akn:art_3 The heading of §3.

-- §1: the preamble and the annex are part of it (the Oz agreement says
-- "annexes").
@ref akn:art_1/p1
`the 1998 Histadrut agreement's preamble and annex are part of it` MEANS TRUE

-- 2.1: every employee in the teaching scale whom הסתדרות המורים
-- represents; 2.3: those in a sabbatical in תשנ"ח, and from תשנ"ט on — the
-- Oz agreement's rule, of the other union's members.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-1 akn:art_2__para_2-3
