    `the 1998 Oz agreement applies to` `in the teaching scale` `represented by הסתדרות המורים`

`the 1998 Histadrut agreement applies in a sabbatical from 5758` MEANS `the 1998 Oz agreement applies in a sabbatical from 5758`

-- 2.2: the government acts to apply it to the teachers of the "owners".
@ref akn:art_2__para_2-2
`applying the 1998 Histadrut agreement to the owners' teachers` MEANS `applying the 1998 agreement to the owners' teachers`

-- §3: from 1.10.97 to 31.12.98, the Oz agreement's period.
@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 1998 Histadrut agreement's period` d IF
    `in the 1998 Oz agreement's period` d

§§ `4 ליווי טיולים ופעילות חוץ בית ספרית`

-- akn:art_4 The heading of §4.

-- (א)–(ג): from 1.9.98 a reward for out-of-school activity with pupils; an
-- activity is one only of the six kinds (four by the hour it ends, a
-- detached one, one with a night away); the reward is counted in activity
-- units, each 0.7% of the teacher's monthly combined salary. The words are
-- the Oz agreement's: its rules, imported. An activity is the Oz module's
-- `1998 Oz out-of-school activity`.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a
`the 1998 Histadrut reward for out-of-school activity starts on` MEANS `the 1998 Oz reward for out-of-school activity starts on`

@ref akn:art_4__para_b akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_4 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_5 akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_6
GIVEN a IS A `1998 Oz out-of-school activity`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an out-of-school activity under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` a IF
    `an out-of-school activity under the 1998 Oz agreement` a

@ref akn:art_4__para_c
GIVEN `the monthly combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the value of an activity unit under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` `the monthly combined salary` IS
    `the value of an activity unit under the 1998 Oz agreement` `the monthly combined salary`

-- (ד): the units by the hour the activity ends — this agreement prints the
-- table's head as a line of its own and the table below it; its rows are
-- the Oz agreement's, held to them here, so its units are the Oz rule's.
-- ¶3: an outing earns only the units beside the hour it ends, never added
-- up — save one with more than one night away, by the nights.
-- F-hh-trips-1998-a: 15:00, 18:00 and 21:00 each close one row and open the
-- next; read as the row the hour opens (convention thresholds.shared-bound).
-- F-hh-trips-1998-b: the table stops at 24:00; an activity ending later with
-- no night away is read with the last row (convention reading.analogy).
-- Both readings are the Oz rule's (F-oz-1998-a, F-oz-1998-b).
@ref akn:art_4__para_d akn:art_4__para_d/p2 akn:art_4__para_d/t1 akn:art_4__para_d/p3
`the rows the Histadrut 1998 table prints` MEANS
    LIST (`row of the 1998 table as printed` OF 14, 15, 0.5),
         (`row of the 1998 table as printed` OF 15, 18, 2),
         (`row of the 1998 table as printed` OF 18, 21, 3.5),
         (`row of the 1998 table as printed` OF 21, 24, 5)

`the units of a detached activity in the Histadrut 1998 table` MEANS 3
`the units of a night away in the Histadrut 1998 table` MEANS 7

GIVEN a IS A `1998 Oz out-of-school activity`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the units a 1998 Histadrut activity earns` a IS
    `the units a 1998 activity earns` a

-- The two tables are one: the same rows, and the same units for a
-- detached activity and a night away.
`the Histadrut 1998 table is the Oz 1998 table` MEANS
        `the rows the Histadrut 1998 table prints` EQUALS `the rows the 1998 table prints`
    AND `the units a 1998 activity earns` `a 1998 detached activity` EQUALS `the units of a detached activity in the Histadrut 1998 table`
    AND `the units a 1998 activity earns` (`a 1998 activity with nights away` 1) EQUALS `the units of a night away in the Histadrut 1998 table`
#ASSERT `the Histadrut 1998 table is the Oz 1998 table`

-- (ה)–(ז): paid with the salary for the month after the activity; salary
-- for none of the hour value, the pension, the training fund, the
-- provident fund or severance; the earlier arrangements cancelled from the
-- start — the Oz agreement's rules.
@ref akn:art_4__para_e
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER @desc the month of the activity
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary month the 1998 Histadrut reward is paid with` y m IS
    `the salary month the 1998 reward is paid with` y m

@ref akn:art_4__para_f
GIVEN p IS A `what the 1998 reward might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1998 Histadrut reward counts as salary for` p IF
    `the 1998 reward counts as salary for` p

@ref akn:art_4__para_g
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the earlier out-of-school arrangements stand under the Histadrut agreement on` d IF
    `the earlier out-of-school arrangements stand on` d

-- (ח): on a day the teacher is not employed in teaching, or for fewer than
-- 4 hours, annex א' pays on top; (ט): not the של"ח teachers, whose
-- arrangement of the eve goes on — the Oz agreement's rules (the של"ח
-- arrangement outside the corpus, as there).
@ref akn:art_4__para_h
GIVEN `hours taught that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `annex א' of the 1998 Histadrut agreement adds to the reward on a day of` `hours taught that day` IF
    `annex א' of the 1998 Oz agreement adds to the reward on a day of` `hours taught that day`

@ref akn:art_4__para_i
GIVEN `a של"ח teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§4 of the 1998 Histadrut agreement pays the teacher` `a של"ח teacher` IF
    `§4 of the 1998 Oz agreement pays the teacher` `a של"ח teacher`

-- (י): the section settles הסתדרות המורים's claims on the out-of-school
-- activity of §30 of its agreement of 11.5.93 (imported): the joint team's
-- proposal on overtime for a teacher's work with pupils outside school,
-- due by 1.9.93, which this section answers five years on.
@ref akn:art_4__para_j
`§4 of the 1998 Histadrut agreement settles the claims of §30 of 11.5.93` MEANS TRUE

`the claims §4 of the 1998 Histadrut agreement settles` MEANS `the 1993 out-of-school overtime proposal`

#ASSERT DATE_SERIAL `the 1998 Histadrut agreement was signed on` GREATER THAN DATE_SERIAL `the 1993 out-of-school overtime proposal is due by`

