GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A `1998 Oz out-of-school activity`
      `the monthly combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `a של"ח teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1998 Histadrut reward for an activity` d a `the monthly combined salary` `a של"ח teacher` IS
    `the 1998 Oz reward for an activity` d a `the monthly combined salary` `a של"ח teacher`

`paying the Histadrut reward for out-of-school activity` MEANS `paying the reward for out-of-school activity`

