§§ `10 הכללת רכיבים לגמל`

-- akn:art_10 The heading of §10.

-- 10.1–10.3: from 1.1.98 contributions to a provident fund on the
-- components neither pensionable nor in Dafna, save the tax gross-up and
-- the imputed benefit; the employer's share costs 0.8% of the pension
-- salary — the Oz agreement's rules. 10.4: the cost comes from §14 of the
-- agreement of 19.9.94 (not yet encoded); 10.5: this section exhausts that
-- §14, and the union raises no claim on contributions to a fund or a
-- pension on components that are not pensionable on its basis.
@ref akn:art_10__para_10-1 akn:art_10__para_10-2 akn:art_10__para_10-3
GIVEN d IS A DATE, p IS A `1998 Oz payment`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `§10 of the 1998 Histadrut agreement brings into the provident fund` d p IF
    `§10 of the 1998 Oz agreement brings into the provident fund` d p

`the cost of the employer's provident-fund share under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` MEANS `the cost of the employer's provident-fund share under the 1998 Oz agreement`

@ref akn:art_10__para_10-4 akn:art_10__para_10-5
`the 1998 Histadrut agreement exhausts §14 of the agreement of 19.9.94` MEANS TRUE

`no claim on §14 of the agreement of 19.9.94` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `raise a claim on contributions under §14 of 19.9.94`

-- What the agreement draws from §14 of 19.9.94: §4's 1.2% and §10's 0.8%.
`what the 1998 Histadrut agreement draws from §14 of 19.9.94` MEANS
    `the cost of §4 of the 1998 Histadrut agreement` PLUS `the cost of the employer's provident-fund share under the 1998 Histadrut agreement`

§§ `11 תגמול ותמרוץ עובדי הוראה נדרשים`

-- akn:art_11 The heading of §11.
-- akn:art_11/p4 A fax banner; no rule.

-- ¶1: §9 of the agreement of 19.9.94 — the reward and incentive for
-- required teachers in the reward localities — stands in this agreement
-- (1998), with these changes (the Oz agreement keeps §21 of its own
-- agreement of 31.8.94 instead, "the quota included"; this one names no
-- quota). ¶2: entitled are the teachers who met the criteria set before,
-- and the teachers in further localities with special educational needs,
-- which a committee of the Ministry with the Treasury decides within a
-- month of the signing. ¶3: entitled are all the teachers who meet the
-- criteria of the director-general's circular נ"ט/1(א) of September 1998
-- (outside the corpus). Whether a locality is one §9 of 19.9.94 covers is a
-- fact of the case: that agreement is not yet encoded.
@ref akn:art_11/p1 akn:art_11/p2 akn:art_11/p3
GIVEN `in a locality §9 of 19.9.94 covers` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in a further locality the committee decided` IS A BOOLEAN
      `meets the criteria of circular נ"ט/1(א)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the reward of required teachers under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` `in a locality §9 of 19.9.94 covers` `in a further locality the committee decided` `meets the criteria of circular נ"ט/1(א)` IF
        `meets the criteria of circular נ"ט/1(א)`
    AND (`in a locality §9 of 19.9.94 covers` OR `in a further locality the committee decided`)

`deciding the further localities for required teachers` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `decide the further localities for the reward of required teachers`
    WITHIN DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 8 10 1998) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `the 1998 Histadrut agreement was signed on`

`why circular נ"ט/1(א) is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "חוזר המנהל הכללי נ\"ט/1(א'), ספטמבר 1998"

