`earlier terms stand unless the 1998 Histadrut agreement changes them` MEANS `earlier terms stand unless the 1998 Oz agreement changes them`

@ref akn:art_12__para_12-3
`the disputes on the 1998 Histadrut agreement's matters stand` MEANS `the disputes on the 1998 Oz agreement's matters stand`

@ref akn:art_12__para_12-4
`industrial peace under the 1998 Histadrut agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter the 1998 Histadrut agreement settled`

